 "title": "Property Tax Payment Options | Scott County, IN",
 "text": "Property Tax Payment Options | Scott County, IN\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nVA Temp Location\nVA Office temporary Location\nRead On...\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nDepartments\nGovernment\nResources\nServices\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nHome\nGovernment\nTreasurer\nProperty Tax Payment Options\nProperty Tax Payment Options\nT reasurer's Drop Box - located by the security entry door on the east side of courthouse 24 hours / 7 days\nBy Mail - Enclose Copy A (Spring) and/or Copy B (Fall) and a check for the amount due. Please include a stamped self-addressed envelope if you request a receipt. Mail to:\nScott County Treasurer\n1 E McClain Avenue\nSuite 140\nScottsburg, IN 47170\nIn Person - The Courthouse reopened to the public on June 1, 2020. Screening questions will/can be asked by security.\nOnline Payments - Online tax information and payments .\nPay by phone - (877) 690-3729; Jurisdiction Code: 2452\nDebit/Credit Cards - (Visa, MasterCard, Discover and American Express) are accepted in office and by phone. There is a processing fee for credit cards at 2.5% and $3.95 flat fee for debit cards, $2.00 for ACH, which is charged by the payment vendor - not the county.\nFor questions concerning:\nTax Amounts - Treasurer's Office\nPhone: 812-752-8414\nDeductions/Exemptions - Auditor's Office\nPhone: 812-752-8408\nAssessments - Assessor's Office\nPhone: 812-752-8436\nParcel Number - Scott County GIS\nProperty Tax Payment Options\nTax Sales\nAgendas & Minutes\nForms\nOnline Bill Pay\nNotify Me®\nEmployment\nDocument\nCenter\n-->\nContact Us\nScott County Government\n1 E. McClain Ave\nScottsburg, IN 47170\nQuick Links\nAgendas & Minutes\nBoards & Commissions\nFAQs\nGIS Maps\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nContact Us\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
